Copyright (c) 2026 Klaudiusz Ledwoch (Steam: Klod76). All rights reserved, except as granted below.

This licence applies to Iron Admiral version 1.2.48 and later. Versions up to and including 1.2.47 were released under the Apache License 2.0 and stay under that licence.

## 1. What this licence covers

The "Work" means the author's own parts of Iron Admiral:

- the DIP_GG_Fixes add-on (source code and compiled DLL),
- the installer, uninstaller and helper scripts,
- the author's changes to the game data files (CSV tables, parameters, texts),
- the historical ship data tables and historical designs made by the author,
- the guide, changelogs, descriptions and other documentation.

Third-party components keep their own licences. See NOTICE.md. Nothing in this licence restricts the rights you have under those licences for the third-party parts.

## 2. What you may do

You may, free of charge:

1. download, install and play the Work;
2. change the Work for your own private use;
3. make videos, streams, screenshots, reviews and guides about the Work, including monetised ones;
4. send fixes, ideas and changes to the author (see CONTRIBUTING.md);
5. link to the official download pages.

## 3. What needs the author's written permission

Without the author's prior written permission you may not:

1. publish, upload or distribute the Work or any modified version of it, in whole or in part, anywhere (including mod sites, forums, file hosts, modpacks and repositories);
2. publish a fork, a translation package or a derived mod based on the Work;
3. include any part of the Work in another mod or project;
4. use the Work or any part of it commercially (selling it, putting it behind a paywall, or bundling it with paid content).

Permission can be asked for through the GitHub repository (issues) or the Nexus Mods page. Permission is given case by case and can be limited in scope.

## 4. Contributions

Contributions are welcome. By sending a contribution you agree to the terms in CONTRIBUTING.md, so that the author can include, change, license and relicense it as part of the Work.

## 5. No warranty

The Work is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. The author is not liable for any damage, loss of data or saved games resulting from its use.

## 6. Unofficial modification

Iron Admiral is an unofficial fan modification of Ultimate Admiral: Dreadnoughts. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Game-Labs.

